
Driver Controller

Sticks - Field Centric Drive (Translation and Rotation)

A - Reef Lock and Auto 
B - Drive to Coral Station
X - Auto Pickup Algae
Y - Slowly Drive into Reef

DPAD - Autoscore with Bumper choosing L/R

UP - L1
RIGHT - L2
DOWN - L3
LEFT - L4

RT - Slow Drive
LT - Intake

RB + Letter Button - Various Pathfinding Commands to Right Pole
LB + Letter Button - Various Pathfinding Commands to Left Pole

Left Middle Button (Squares) - Hold to Reset Orientation


Operator Controller

Right Stick - Unintake

A - Intake
B - Low Algae
X - Spit Algae
Y - High Algae

RT - Climb
LT - Deploy Climber

RB + Letter Button - Various Pathfinding Commands to Right Pole
LB + Letter Button 

Menu Button - Hold to Reset Elevator


Both 

Squares + Menu - Swap Controllers
